hiddenFeatures.tipBody:
View and toggle hidden Windows features rolled out through the A/B experiment mechanism (Velocity feature configurations).

Tips:
① Search by name or ID (17,000+ known features). Press Enter or click 'Search';
② Enable/disable writes to the Runtime store immediately and, by default, also to the Boot store (persists across reboots);
③ If something breaks, use the 'Reset' button on the row to restore defaults;
④ Entries shown as plain numbers are internal system configs with no public meaning — not recommended to modify.

⚠ Experimental features may destabilize the system. Only change features you understand.
